PHP 7.4: back-port upstream's PHP_TEST_BUILD fix — LINK the conftest, don't RUN it

This is upstream's own change, taken from php-src PHP-8.3, applied to 7.4 because
7.4 is end-of-life and never received it.

`PHP_TEST_BUILD` in 7.4 and 8.0 is AC_RUN_IFELSE: it compiles, links AND EXECUTES
a probe program. ext/gd/config.m4 uses it with `$GD_SHARED_LIBADD`, so configure
runs a binary linked against libpng, libwebp, libjpeg and freetype. On macOS that
binary dies before it reaches main:

    ./configure: line 2481: Illegal instruction: 4  ./conftest
    configure:36285: $? = 132
    configure: error: GD build test failed. Please check the config.log for details.

132 is SIGILL. A static initializer in one of those libraries traps. Nothing is
wrong with gd, and the message names the one thing that is innocent — which is
what made this expensive to find.

By PHP 8.3 upstream had changed the macro to **AC_LINK_IFELSE**: the probe is
linked and never executed, so a library that cannot survive its own constructor
in a throwaway conftest no longer blocks the build. That is why static-php-cli
builds gd for 8.x and could not for 7.4 — the same libraries, one macro apart.

Both hunks are upstream's:
  * build/php.m4       AC_RUN_IFELSE -> AC_LINK_IFELSE, and a real prototype
                       (`char $1(void)` / `int main(void)`)
  * ext/gd/config.m4   `char foobar () {}` -> `char foobar(void) { return '\0'; }`
                       — the old stub also fell off the end of a non-void
                       function, which clang 16+ turns into a trap of its own.

Verified against php-src PHP-8.3.31's build/php.m4 and ext/gd/config.m4.

--- a/build/php.m4	2026-08-14 22:51:56
+++ b/build/php.m4	2026-08-14 22:51:56
@@ -1645,10 +1645,10 @@
 AC_DEFUN([PHP_TEST_BUILD], [
   old_LIBS=$LIBS
   LIBS="$4 $LIBS"
-  AC_RUN_IFELSE([AC_LANG_SOURCE([[
+  AC_LINK_IFELSE([AC_LANG_SOURCE([[
     $5
-    char $1();
-    int main() {
+    char $1(void);
+    int main(void) {
       $1();
       return 0;
     }
--- a/ext/gd/config.m4	2026-08-14 22:51:56
+++ b/ext/gd/config.m4	2026-08-14 22:51:56
@@ -173,7 +173,7 @@
 
     PHP_TEST_BUILD(foobar, [], [
       AC_MSG_ERROR([GD build test failed. Please check the config.log for details.])
-    ], [ $GD_SHARED_LIBADD ], [char foobar () {}])
+    ], [ $GD_SHARED_LIBADD ], [char foobar(void) { return '\0'; }])
 
   else
     extra_sources="gd_compat.c"
